1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,855
Only the owner and administrators see these pages: the school's plan and usage, its settings, and its branding.

2
00:00:08,586 --> 00:00:12,952
Open Plan and usage. Sunrise Public School is on the Free plan.

3
00:00:13,676 --> 00:00:22,894
Usage shows how much of each limit is used: students, staff accounts, administrators, storage, and publications this year.

4
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:31,866
Compare plans shows what each plan includes. ScoreCode does not take payments in the app; to change plan, write to ScoreCode.

5
00:00:33,207 --> 00:00:42,388
The owner can start one free trial of the Pro features, for thirty days. No card is needed, and afterwards the school simply returns to Free.

6
00:00:43,809 --> 00:00:49,984
Now Settings. The official name and address appear on every marksheet, so check them carefully.

7
00:00:51,226 --> 00:00:55,907
Add the board under Affiliation, here C B S E, and save the changes.

8
00:00:57,089 --> 00:01:07,070
Results policy decides how students activate their accounts, what the verification page shows, what class statistics students see, and their language.

9
00:01:08,975 --> 00:01:14,490
Under Branding, upload the school's logo. It appears on the portal and on marksheets.

10
00:01:15,227 --> 00:01:20,876
Colours and the login page design come with the Starter plan and above, so they are locked here.

11
00:01:22,819 --> 00:01:27,831
Next, the audit log, notifications, and exporting the school's data.
